  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Divination; <strong>CL</strong> 1th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> eyes; <strong>Price</strong> 1,200 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis goggles look like simple goggles used by fliers, but closer inspection reveals that the glasses can be rotated. Moving both glasses to the right position provides the effects of the standard divine effect of the Divination sphere. The effect persists until the user ceases concentration, after which both glasses snap back to their original position. These goggles can be used 3 times per day.<br>\n<strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Marvelous Item, Divination sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 600 gp</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/marvelous-items-2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
